# Project Requirements Overview

## Project Summary

The AI Job Management System is a comprehensive platform designed specifically for small Australian trade businesses. This modular system aims to streamline operations, improve customer satisfaction, increase profitability, and ensure compliance through 13 integrated modules. The platform leverages AI technology to automate routine tasks, enhance communication, and provide real-time insights into business performance.

## Core Modules & Requirements

### 1. Job Scheduling System

**Functional Requirements:**
- Calendar-based job scheduling interface for assigning team members to jobs
- Detailed job cards with scope of work, materials list, and task instructions
- Appointment scheduling for sales visits with auto-conversion to jobs upon quote acceptance
- Real-time synchronization across all devices (mobile, tablet, desktop)
- Integration with other modules (communication, profitability tracking)

**Technical Requirements:**
- Calendar view component with day, week, and month visualization
- Drag-and-drop functionality for scheduling
- User role-based access controls
- Push notifications for schedule changes
- Offline capabilities with sync on reconnection

### 2. Job Profitability Tracker

**Functional Requirements:**
- Real-time tracking of job costs against income
- Mobile check-in/out system for labor tracking
- Materials tracking through supplier invoice uploads and inventory logs
- Live dashboard displaying job margins and profitability metrics
- Alert system for budget overruns

**Technical Requirements:**
- Integration with accounting software (Xero/MYOB)
- GPS verification for check-ins/outs
- OCR capability for invoice processing
- Real-time calculation of labor costs based on hourly rates
- Threshold-based alert system

### 3. Overhead & Target Tracker

**Functional Requirements:**
- Monthly revenue target setting and tracking
- Operating overhead monitoring
- Dashboard showing business financial health
- Alert system for performance issues
- Strategic decision support tools

**Technical Requirements:**
