## Non-Functional Requirements

### Usability
- Intuitive user interface for trade professionals
- Mobile-first design approach
- Minimal training required for basic operations
- Consistent design language across all modules

### Performance
- Page load times under 2 seconds
- Real-time data updates without page refresh
- Support for up to 50 concurrent users
- Efficient operation on 4G mobile connections

### Security
- Role-based access control
- End-to-end encryption for sensitive data
- Compliance with Australian privacy regulations
- Secure authentication with multi-factor options
- Regular security audits and updates

### Scalability
- Support for businesses with 5-50 employees
- Ability to handle up to 500 active jobs
- Storage capacity for historical data (5+ years)
- Modular architecture allowing for selective implementation

### Reliability
- 99.9% uptime during business hours
- Automated backup system
- Offline functionality for critical features
- Graceful degradation when connectivity is limited

### Integration
- API-first architecture
- Standard connectors for common accounting software
- Webhook support for third-party integrations
- Bulk import/export capabilities

## Technical Stack Recommendations

Based on the existing project architecture:

### Frontend
- React with TypeScript
- TailwindCSS for styling
- TanStack Query for data fetching
- FormBuilder for dynamic forms

### Backend
- Supabase for database, authentication, and storage
- Supabase Edge Functions for serverless operations
- PostgreSQL for relational data

### AI Components
- OpenAI API for natural language processing
- Whisper API for voice transcription
- Fine-tuned models for industry-specific terminology

### Mobile Access
- Progressive Web App (PWA) approach
- React Native consideration for future native apps

